  "description": "VOGNOW crystallizes in the hexagonal crystal system with space group P 61. Reported CIF formula moiety: C54 H115 Co3 Dy3 N3 O25 2+,2(C2 H3 N1),2(N1 O3 1-),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.271-3.904 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.50-110.31°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [(CoIII)3Dy3(μ3-OH)4(O2CtBu)6(L)3](NO3)2·2CH3CN·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies Co(III).",
